  "title": "Scallops and Spinach Over Pasta",
  "description": "This scallops and spinach recipe with lemon juice, garlic, and olive oil is quick to make. Serve over hot spaghetti for an enjoyable pasta night dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Kim Robichaud"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-08-10T11:14:23-04:00",
